bvious sign of the righteous judgment of God, to the end that you may be counted worthy of God’s Kingdom, for which you also suffer."},{"verse":6,"text":"For it is a righteous thing with God to repay affliction to those who afflict you,"},{"verse":7,"text":"and to give relief to you who are afflicted with us when the Lord Jesus is revealed from heaven with his mighty angels in flaming fire,"},{"verse":8,"text":"punishing those who don’t know God, and to those who don’t obey the Good News of our Lord Jesus,"},{"verse":9,"text":"who will pay the penalty: eternal destruction from the face of the Lord and from the glory of his might,"},{"verse":10,"text":"when he comes in that day to be glorified in his saints and to be admired among all those who have believed, because our testimony to you was believed."},{"verse":11,"text":"To this end we also pray always for you that our God may count you worthy of your calling, and fulfill every desire of goodness and work of faith with power,"},{"verse":12,"text":"that the name of our Lord Jesus may be glorified in you, and you in him, according to the grace of our God and the Lord Jesus Christ."}],"hasArtwork":false,"availableLangs":[]}]